- **Step 2 (webapp)**: FastAPI app `backend/main.py` + `backend/api/` (models, deps, routers `extract`, `sessions`, `settings`) on :8010; Vue 3 / Vite 7 / Pinia / Tailwind v4 / vue-router in `frontend/` on :5180 (`strictPort`, `/api` proxy). Root `npm run dev` runs both via concurrently. Screens: `DashboardView`, `NewApplicationView`, `SessionView` (tabs overview / files / questions / log; files + questions are placeholders).
